        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary pt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Architected and deployed the enterprise corporate portal and automated biometric attendance infrastructure (Java 21, Spring Boot, React, PostgreSQL). Automated multi-shift employee scheduling, live push synchronization from biometric devices, and role-based staff operations with 100% record accuracy.
